---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { moneyText } from "./monetization";
import "./monetization-controls.css";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang),
  m = moneyText(lang, "graduated-pricing");
---

<section
  data-demo="graduated-pricing"
  data-money
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={m.resetMessage}
>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">{m.fiction}</p>
    <h2>{t("Graduated pricing", "구간별 누진 단가", "区分別累進単価")}</h2>
  </header>
  <p>{m.baseline}</p>
  <table>
    <caption>{t("Shared tier table", "공통 구간표", "共通の区分表")}</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">{m.exports}</th>
        <th scope="col">{t("Unit price", "단가", "単価")}</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row">0–100</th>
        <td>0.20</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row">101+</th>
        <td>0.10</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <ol class="slices">
    <li>
      {t(
        "First slice: up to 100 × 0.20",
        "첫 구간: 최대 100 × 0.20",
        "最初の区分：最大100 × 0.20",
      )}
    </li>
    <li>
      {t(
        "Later slice: remainder × 0.10",
        "다음 구간: 나머지 × 0.10",
        "次の区分：残り × 0.10",
      )}
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div
    class="quantity-cases"
    role="group"
    aria-label={t(
      "Compare boundary quantities",
      "경계 수량 비교",
      "境界の数量を比較",
    )}
  >
    <button type="button" data-quantity-preset="100" data-interactive disabled>
      <span>{t("Quantity", "수량", "数量")} 100</span>
      <strong>→ 20.00</strong>
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-quantity-preset="101" data-interactive disabled>
      <span>{t("Quantity", "수량", "数量")} 101</span>
      <strong>→ 20.10</strong>
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-quantity-preset="1000" data-interactive disabled>
      <span>{t("Quantity", "수량", "数量")} 1000</span>
      <strong>→ 110.00</strong>
    </button>
  </div>
  <label>
    {m.exports}
    <input
      type="number"
      min="0"
      max="10000"
      step="1"
      value="120"
      data-quantity
      data-interactive
      disabled
    />
  </label>
  <div class="controls">
    <button type="button" data-less data-interactive disabled>
      {t("Remove one", "1 감소", "1減らす")}
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-more data-interactive disabled>
      {t("Add one", "1 추가", "1増やす")}
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="result">
    <span>{m.total}</span>
    <output data-total>22.00</output>
    <p data-formula>100 × 0.20 + 20 × 0.10 = 22.00</p>
  </div>
  <p>
    {t(
      "Same usage with the other tier method",
      "같은 사용량의 다른 구간 방식",
      "同じ利用量で別の区分方式",
    )}
    : <b data-peer>12.00</b>
  </p>
  <p>
    {t(
      "No tier flat fees. Zero usage costs zero.",
      "구간 고정료는 없습니다. 사용량 0은 요금도 0입니다.",
      "区分固定料はありません。利用量0は料金も0です。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="assumptions">{m.omitted}</p>
  <div class="controls">
    <button type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
      {m.reset}
    </button>
  </div>
  <p data-contract-context class="contract-context">
    {t(
      "The customer pays 0.20 for each of the first 100 monthly exports and 0.10 thereafter. At 120, the bill is 20 + 2 = 22; at 101 it is 20.10. Zero usage costs zero in this offer.",
      "고객은 월 첫 100회에 각각 0.20, 이후 각각 0.10을 냅니다. 120회는 20+2=22, 101회는 20.10입니다. 이 조건의 0회는 0입니다.",
      "顧客は月の最初の100回に各0.20、その後に各0.10を払います。120回は20＋2＝22、101回は20.10です。この条件の0回は0です。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountPricing } from "./monetization-pricing";
  mountPricing("graduated-pricing", 120);
</script>
<style>
  .slices {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .slices li {
    border-bottom: 4px solid #52766e;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    background: #fff;
  }
  @container (max-width:450px) {
    .slices {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .result {
    background: #e1ece8;
    border: 2px solid #52766e;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .result p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .quantity-cases {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
  .quantity-cases button {
    flex: 1 1 130px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 2px solid currentColor;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .quantity-cases strong {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  .result output {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7cqi, 4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .slices {
    gap: 0;
    border: 4px solid #4c6751;
    padding: 0;
    list-style-position: inside;
  }
  .slices li {
    padding: 24px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .slices li + li {
    border-top: 4px dashed #4c6751;
  }
</style>
